OL,3,GNEWSAOne dead and hundreds ill in UK
OL,4,Asalmonella outbreak
OL,5,
OL,6,FA person has died and hundreds have
OL,7,Ffallen ill with salmonella food
OL,8,Fpoisoning in an outbreak that UK
OL,9,Fexperts believe is linked to eating
OL,10,Ffood made with imported eggs.
OL,12,FThe UK Health Security Agency has
OL,13,Flaunched an investigation, external
OL,14,Finto the 207 cases it has seen in the
OL,15,Fpast year, with most recorded in recent
OL,16,Fweeks.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
