OL,3,GNEWSAOne dead and hundreds ill in UK
OL,4,Asalmonella outbreak
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than a third of those affected -
OL,7,Fsome babies and others as old as 90 -
OL,8,Fhave needed hospital care, with two
OL,9,Fdeveloping serious blood poisoning.
OL,10,FMost people get better without
OL,11,Ftreatment, however.
OL,13,FWhile salmonella cases can happen any
OL,14,Ftime, this outbreak involves a
OL,15,Fspecific, identical strain.
